      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 54
      }
    },
    "text": "Unhappiness in families is generally more due to the lack of fulfilment in relationships rather than a lack of physical facilities, as physical facilities alone are not adequate to ensure human happiness.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 54
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0009",
    "task_id": "task_0009",
    "strategy": "fill_existing",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 57
      }
    },
    "text": "Currently, most of the time and effort (often the vast majority) is invested in accumulating physical facilities, whereas significantly less time and effort are spent on ensuring right understanding and fulfilment in relationships.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 56
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
