      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 73
      }
    },
    "text": "1. The basic human aspiration is continuous happiness and prosperity.\n2. For a human being, physical facility is necessary but NOT adequate; right understanding (in the self) and relationship (with human beings) are also required.\n3. Living only for physical facility leads to animal consciousness, whereas living for all three with the right priority leads to human consciousness.\n4. Holistic development is the transformation from animal consciousness to human consciousness.\n5. The role of education\u2013sanskar is to enable this transformation.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 73
